 pve-qemu-kvm (11.1.3-3) trixie; urgency=medium
 
   * async snapshot: report in 'query-savevm' whether the 'savevm-end' command
     is still running. qemu-server 9.2.20 uses this to tell when the command
     finished after saving the VM state failed, instead of waiting for its
     timeout. Also avoid a crash when a second 'savevm-end' command arrives
     while the first one still waits for the state file to be closed.
 
